Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:10.85,title3,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz270\pos(440,162)}白色的、繫著蝴蝶結的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:10.85,title3,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz270\pos(400,88)}連衣裙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:41.74,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何ページも費やして　つづられた僕らの気分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.89,0:00:48.99,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうしてか一行の　空白を埋められない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:57.12,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}押花のしおりはさんで　君と転がす使い捨ての自転車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:01:04.71,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忘れかけのレンガを　積み上げた場所に行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:09.95,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}海を見渡す坂を駆けのぼって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.50,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こわいくらいに青い空と
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:22.25,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手にサイダー　左手はずっと君をさがしている
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:30.00,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そうやって今は僕の方へ　問いつめることもなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:36.91,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}まだ二人はすぐそこに居るのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:42.88,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうかまた会えますように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:52.71,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんて　どうかしてるみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:41.74,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}使用好幾頁 填補了我們的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.89,0:00:48.99,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}卻彌補不了那唯一的一行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:57.12,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}夾上乾花書籤 和你乘上騎一次就扔的自行車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:01:04.71,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}前往用幾乎遺忘的磚頭堆積起來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.42,0:01:09.95,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}爬上望得見海的小坡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.50,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}頭上是湛藍的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:22.25,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手是碳酸飲料 左手一直在尋求著你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:30.00,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}現在呢 你也不會再追問我什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:36.91,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}兩個人明明還在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:42.88,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}而我卻祈願能再次相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:52.71,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可能是我的錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:21:01.56,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:04.66,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望　忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:11.37,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:19.45,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:31.84,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}出会いは　ふっとした　瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:35.45,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}帰り道の交差点で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:41.25,edjp2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}声をかけてくれたね「一緒に帰ろう」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:47.78,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　花火が夜空　きれいに咲いて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:49.93,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}ちょっとセツナク
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.20,0:21:56.60,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}あぁ　風が時間とともに　流れる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:22:04.01,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}嬉しくって　楽しくって　冒険も　いろいろしたね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:11.00,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}二人の　秘密の　基地の中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:14.98,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:18.18,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望を忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:25.28,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.47,0:22:27.33,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君が最後まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:32.51,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}心から「ありがとう」叫んでたこと　知ってたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:36.25,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}涙をこらえて　笑顔でさようなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:39.51,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}せつないよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.95,0:22:48.41,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:21:01.56,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:04.66,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:11.37,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:19.45,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:31.84,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}邂逅是瞬間的巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:35.45,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在回家的路口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:41.25,edcn2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}你對我說「一起回去吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:47.78,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊 煙花在夜空裡絢麗地綻放
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:49.93,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.20,0:21:56.60,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}啊 風隨著時間一起流動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:22:04.01,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}開心的 愉快的冒險也經歷過很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:11.00,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在兩個人的秘密基地裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:14.98,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:18.18,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:25.28,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.47,0:22:27.33,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}我知道你自始至終
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:32.51,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}都在心裡喊「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:36.25,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}強忍淚水 笑著說再見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.26,0:22:39.51,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.95,0:22:48.41,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來不只有你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能看到芽間的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.53,0:02:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.99,0:02:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海  怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間有一個就足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.19,0:02:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}芽間  在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…之前你不是準備來學校嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  她們兩個也不是有惡意…下次…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.91,0:02:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒在意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真…真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  不管你還有你的朋友說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對我的人生絲毫沒有影響
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這算什麼  真不可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也沒想可愛  又不是老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下宿海…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.13,0:03:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝…  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑  你蠢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…  宿海
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下…  要是連你也變成芽間那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  芽間出現在你身邊了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:45.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然還是喜歡芽間的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為喜歡  實際上看不見的東西才會看見吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:04:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你剛才不也說相信也好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不明白  能看見芽間的話請對她好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不明白  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  仁太  去你那邊了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.70,0:04:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果還是沒找到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切  真無聊  芽間也想看的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了  肉烤好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集  你一個人在這輕鬆什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}哇  肉肉  肉肉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}哇  好好吃的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是芽間的請求啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.31,0:04:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間出現在我面前的時候說了「不要再大驚小怪了」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  芽間她這麼說了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然沒有聽清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:05:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,願望什麼的  隨便的亂猜  給人添麻煩不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那回事！  芽間…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家聚集在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家回憶起芽間的事情  這樣的話芽間會開心更多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間就算死了  也希望大家一直做好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…所以
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了…芽間這麼說了的話  還是算了比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…或許
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明不是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.51,0:05:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  大家  看下這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒸麵包？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  好懷念  這不是仁太媽媽經常做的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  好懷念
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個  是芽間做的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說幽靈做了蒸麵包？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這話題也太勁爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久川也這麼想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個…  我覺得很新穎…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.85,0:06:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算被覺得噁心  被覺得不正常都無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間所說的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「大家聚在一起很開心」「沒有忘記我很開心」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就說到這兒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無法忘記芽間  一直被芽間所束縛  你真沒出息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉  真掃興  剩下的大家吃了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉…  我也回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒸麵包  大家吃了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家…喂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說  事情變得詭異起來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久川看到的芽間是什麼感覺？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃…  穿著白色的連衣裙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一塊是不是繫著小蝴蝶結？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？  雖然記不太清楚  好像有這感覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼知道？  啊  你也看見芽間了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰曉得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子  你還是神秘女孩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶…仁太  雪集看到的芽間是什麼樣的芽間呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間是芽里奧的話  那她就是芽路易了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2P選不同顏色玩的話就有意思了呢  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  雪集那傢伙真莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間說別吵了？  真是個超級意淫蛋疼孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最蛋疼的孩子是我…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:55.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  沒法原諒…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做出隨意的將芽間的感情曲解的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然還是喜歡芽間的吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.12,0:09:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說好孩子仁太君在這兒我才來的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  好孩子雷達有反應  嗶嗶~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是芽間哦  是布偶和圓木偶的妖精哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開個玩笑啦  正確答案是芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還正確答案…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是沒變呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:55.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  住手~  嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:10:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  仁太是…喜歡芽間的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事…  該睡覺了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關燈了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  那時候…  你對於我其實是怎麼想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胸前繫著蝴蝶結的連衣裙…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.85,0:11:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔子  我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太君  今天收錢的大叔大概會來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,錢在最上層抽屜裡記得拿給他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.23,0:11:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您慢走~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢走…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出門了~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒啥…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.07,0:11:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然天氣依舊炎熱…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}哇  總覺得這人的頭真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說來  從那之後就再沒去過學校  她也沒說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}要掉下去了  掉下去了  危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收錢的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:11:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不去上學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在準備文化祭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:06.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們班要搞無伴奏卡拉OK咖啡店
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是很無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能進來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  你為什麼來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.56,0:12:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點都沒變呢  真懷念
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海君家為什麼用暖爐還鋪木質地板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  點心  要給客人上點心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  我這裡只有COUNTRY  MA'AM
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（不二家於1984年發售的點心，類似於夾心餅乾）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個蒸麵包
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起宿海君媽媽做的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微有點硬呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.11,0:12:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麵粉篩選得還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果用了泡打粉的話應該會更加膨鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間做的不好吃原來不是因為葡萄乾放的太少啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你原來會做料理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.02,0:13:05.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,料理什麼的只要知道菜譜  人人都能做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間沒能做成功
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.34,0:13:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前提是沒有搞錯份量和火候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  只要沒有碰上什麼奇怪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是來幹什麼的  我可沒什麼好的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:23.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有言在先
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間做了蒸麵包這種事我果然難以相信
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.63,0:13:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛  也是  你不相信是理所當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  正因為如此我有件事想要拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是  你猜他說了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「你的味道真香  你腋下的味道肯定更香」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.29,0:14:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  這算哪門子的花言巧語啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  鳴子  有什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…  不好意思  我想起了件急事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  鳴子她啊  最近有點不好相處啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  有點莫名的不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是宿海吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一看便知吧  那亂糟糟的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在這種地方想要幹嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超和平Busters的活動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要打破虛偽的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  仁太  真的要做嗎  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二學期已經開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這樣在外面閒逛沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間一直吵著要出來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:18.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所見到的芽間是什麼樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  說錯了  我家的芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說你看到的芽間是冒牌貨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.66,0:15:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來大家準備去秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  芽間也一起去  如果可以的話你也…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在得意個什麼勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在已經不是你當領隊的過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  那個時候我也沒有服過你就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要隨便和我搭話  你這個喪家犬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到…  到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好膽量  宿海君
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.49,0:16:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間  出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓那傢伙看看你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.95,0:16:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明明沒有來的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很閒啦  真是的  有什麼關係嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.45,0:16:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要用嗎  上次燒烤後覺得身上很癢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事  話說回來  你就不能少賣點肉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}仁太才不是喪家犬呢  是一個贏家犬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼關係  很可愛不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說都是狗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集看到的芽間可能不是冒牌貨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為  就算有另一個芽間這也不奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為  芽間到底為什麼會在這裡仍舊是個謎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砰砰砰砰  嘰嘰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  為什麼大家都聚在一起  派對之夜？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  你快點把燈關掉  很刺眼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  Sorry  Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:40.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好喝  果然和罐裝咖啡不一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸媽在義賣會時買了個新的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有點舊了  但可以的話就放在這裡用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還真是個好人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且連杯子都帶來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:18:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然和大家在一起很開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間能這樣和大家待一起真的很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  這也讓芽間喝喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嗎  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間  你在嗎  在這裡？  在那裡？  請用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燒烤後我就在想了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間說過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「大家能聚集在一起我很高興」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感覺這確實很像芽間會說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常同意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還說「不想被遺忘」  怎麼可能會忘記她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間還真是會多操心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}怎麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗  最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.54,0:18:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚  渾身發涼  咖啡喝多了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小便大解放
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間也要去  一起去小便
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「忘記不了芽間」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「一直被芽間所束縛  你真是可憐啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  鶴子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集所說的全都是指的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是  這是啥呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}你在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,門戶大開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這個  出現了  她出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.24,0:19:39.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡  這裡  快點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的  我已經確認過了  鶴子不說過嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是連衣裙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡附近繫著蝴蝶結的那種
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繫著蝴蝶結的連衣裙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  仁太  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:10.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那個  是芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.79,0:20:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  仁太  一個人很危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…  我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍…  稍微讓我休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  你那邊怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才還在這附近的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法  先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉  那麼龐大的身軀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.65,0:20:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算再怎麼剃腿毛  還是有點困難呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:20:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.71,0:21:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.11,0:21:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
